story=[p('Advertiser Demand<br/>Decision Lab','TitleX'),p('Which campaign-planning bottleneck deserves investigation first?','Deck'),p('Brandon Crain | Campaign-planning analytics | October 2026','SmallX'),Spacer(1,12),p('The decision','H'),p('Investigate planning completion first in the default fixture. Of 300 usable current attempts, 120 complete a plan and 96 launch. Baseline counts are 210 and 150. The planning drop-off rises 30 percentage points under a shared denominator; validate the reason before choosing an intervention.'),p('The priority is deliberately conditional. At 50% recovery assumptions, stage-specific diagnostic scores are 30 for planning and 4 for launch follow-through per 100 eligible attempts. They are not predicted launches or equal business value. Planning recovery near 6.7% equalizes those scores when assumed launch recovery is 50%.'),p('A recommendation that can change','H')]
